      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "COPARTNER PEGASUS (3) comes here deep into the campaign and due for a change of luck on the backup. Just under a month between runs when he closed strongly to secure second over this track and trip. Can race closer here and shed his Maiden status at start eleven. CORAL COVE (1) improving with racing and looks ready for the extra ground at his fourth race start. Tagged the speed and kept finding with a narrow third over 1400m at Kembla Grange. Bred to get through the conditions and has genuine winning claims. MR REIBY (2) tongue-tie goes on and finds an easier contest after he folded top late when fifth over 1400m in a Super Maiden at Kembla Grange. Improver. FLETCHER (4) gets weight relief again at his third race start after he struggled to handle the Wyong circuit when sixth over 1350m. Don't dismiss.",
